   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking for something",
     "texto": [
      "**Мне нужно + infinitive** expresses necessity. To complete a specific task, these examples use the perfective (**отправить**, **открыть**, **заплатить**): **Мне нужно отправить письмо** («I need to send a letter»). **Можно + infinitive?** asks whether an action is possible or allowed: **Можно открыть счёт?** («Can I open an account?»). The perfective focuses on the result; it does not simply mean «once»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Location and payment",
     "texto": [
      "To say where you are: **на почте** (at the post office), **в банке** (at the bank). To go there: **на почту**, **в банк**. Payment is expressed with the instrumental: **картой** (by card; from **карта**). **Кассир** works at a till; in the dialogue for opening an account, **сотрудник банка** (bank employee) is more precise."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
